[203.316752, "o", "T-128 has STALE_STATISTICS because 45 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 280, bloat ratio 0.28, and cap 0.10. A bloat ratio 0.28 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2208b qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.\r\n"]
[203.316923, "o", "T-50 has STALE_STATISTICS because 33 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 155, bloat ratio 0.16, and cap 0.10. A bloat ratio 0.16 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2213 qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.\r\nT-09 has STALE_STATISTICS because 30 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 190, bloat ratio 0.19, and cap 0.10. A bloat ratio 0.19 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2215 qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.\r\nT-96 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.21 from dead_pages 205 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.2; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding.\r\n"]
[203.317271, "o", "T-127 has AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because vacuum_type is manual, which overrides autovacuum even though autovacuum_enabled=True; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000 with dead_pages 50, bloat ratio 0.05, and cap 0.2.\r\n"]
