[317.435008, "o", "\\nsample nonnone lines\r\nT-82 183 T-82 has STALE_STATISTICS because 55 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 80, bloat ratio 0.08, and cap 0.10.\r\nT-128 304 T-128 has STALE_STATISTICS because 45 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 280, bloat ratio 0.28, and cap 0.10. A bloat ratio 0.28 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2208b qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.\r\nT-130 302 T-130 has STALE_STATISTICS because 40 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed small class is derived from total_pages 400, dead_pages 160, bloat ratio 0.40, and cap 0.35. A bloat ratio 0.40 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2210 qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.\r\nT-50 302 T-50 has STALE_STATISTICS because 33 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 155, bloat ratio 0."]
[317.435222, "o", "16, and cap 0.10. A bloat ratio 0.16 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2213 qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.\r\nT-09 302 T-09 has STALE_STATISTICS because 30 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 190, bloat ratio 0.19, and cap 0.10. A bloat ratio 0.19 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2215 qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.\r\nT-64 320 T-64 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.21 from dead_pages 210 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.10; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding. Stats are stale at 30 days, which tightened the cap to 0.10.\r\nT-78 257 T-78 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.41 from dead_pages 164 / total_pages 400 exceeds its small cap 0.4; the small class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppres"]
[317.435407, "o", "ses this bloat finding.\r\nT-125 342 T-125 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.30 from dead_pages 300 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.2; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding. Change-control ticket note: ticket CH-2205 valid_until 2026-09-01 not after audit.\r\nT-96 258 T-96 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.21 from dead_pages 205 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.2; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding.\r\nT-119 328 T-119 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.30 from dead_pages 300 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.2; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding. Reindex was not exempt since reindex valid_until 2026-09-01 expired.\r\nT-123 317 T-123 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_"]
[317.435602, "o", "EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.32 from dead_pages 320 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.2; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding. Change-control ticket note: ticket CH-2203 status closed.\r\nT-02 330 T-02 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.35 from dead_pages 350 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.2; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding. Change-control ticket note: ticket CH-2100 exception_type REINDEX_HOLD.\r\nT-05 311 T-05 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.55 from dead_pages 550 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.2; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding. Reindex was not exempt since reindex approved=False.\r\nT-129 316 T-129 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat "]
[317.435825, "o", "ratio 0.29 from dead_pages 290 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.2; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding. Change-control ticket note: ticket CH-2209b status Open.\r\nT-127 233 T-127 has AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because vacuum_type is manual, which overrides autovacuum even though autovacuum_enabled=True; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000 with dead_pages 50, bloat ratio 0.05, and cap 0.2.\r\n"]
